  "description": "RIDE WITH JOY. The new Macina Joy offers the ideal entry point into the world of e-bikes, impressing with an especially attractive price-performance ratio. The name JOY is already well established within the KTM range. For many years, it has stood for the popular Life Joy models, representing a straightforward introduction to the world of trekking bikes – combined with reliable quality, excellent everyday usability, and a fair price. The Macina Joy now brings these values into the e-bike segment, making the transition to electric mobility easier than ever. The new Bosch Hub Line provides support with up to 45 Nm of torque and up to 400 W of power. The lightweight hub motor is seamlessly integrated into the rear wheel, delivering an agile and dynamic riding experience. Paired with KTM’s well-balanced trekking geometry, longer distances, gentle climbs, and daily commutes can be handled with ease. The standard specification includes all the components that define a modern trekking bike: a powerful lighting system, mudguards, and a luggage rack. This means the bike is ready from day one for everyday use, leisure rides, and longer tours.",
